[[Leather Boots]] are an epic pair of [[shoes]] available in the shop for all classes. Once the player's health falls somewhat, it will activate, giving 1 {{icon/luck}}, 1 {{icon/empower}}, and 15 {{icon/block}}, once. This is a mildly useful effect, but the [[Leather Boots]] need to be crafted or synergized to be well-worth the space they take up.

The [[Dragonskin Boots]] can be trivially crafted by a [[Berserker]], using the [[Forging Hammer]] or [[Utility Pouch]]. It's slightly better than the original [[Leather Boots]]. It gives {{icon/cold}} resistance, cleanses debuffs, still gives 1 {{icon/empower}}, and gives slightly more {{icon/block}}.

The other crafts are clearer upgrades.

[[Leather Boots]] and [[Stone Skin Potion]] combine into the [[Stone Shoes]], which gives much more {{icon/block}} than the [[Leather Boots]], and also gives a big damage reduction for certain damage types for a significant period after triggering.

[[Leather Boots]] and [[Divine Potion]] combine into the [[Winged Boots]], which, while taking up one more square than the other boots, has the powerful effect of cleansing 20 debuffs and dodging three attacks.

The [[Full Body Protection]] skill requires the player to have one [[helmet]], one [[armor]], and one [[shoes]] to take full effect, which makes buying a [[Leather Boots]] very important.
